1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 7]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:36,540
I clearly saw 15.

14
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,410
These wool balls really...

15
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:43,050
Forget it.

16
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,050
You never believe a word I say.

17
00:01:49,430 --> 00:01:49,930
I believe you.

18
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:16,820
♪I was raised♪

19
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:21,580
♪Amid cast-off bones and alleyways...♪

20
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:25,890
What is that thing?

21
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,450
Catch it, and we'll find out.

22
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:31,780
Fine.

23
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:33,660
It's your turn now,

24
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,380
Master Zhang.

25
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,010
Show me what you've got.

26
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:43,060
♪And weathered every storm♪

27
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:49,100
♪Through another life, I look back once more♪

28
00:03:50,140 --> 00:03:54,420
♪But who can I tell?♪

29
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:59,140
♪Beneath the iron curtain, the rain leaves me blind and deaf for now♪

30
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,740
♪The child with a dog has nowhere to call home♪

31
00:04:01,740 --> 00:04:06,460
♪One vow between kindred souls makes death worthwhile♪

32
00:04:07,260 --> 00:04:09,740
♪How could comrades standing side by side let loyalty grow cold?♪

33
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:12,380
♪I'll shatter bone and sinew to make the show go on♪

34
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:14,500
♪Fight on, fight on♪

35
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:21,540
♪Till Heaven's Gate lies trampled and broken...♪

36
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,410
Notice anything?

37
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:36,140
It's like a crow.

38
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:37,490
It likes pretty things.

39
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,250
It stops when it sees something shiny.

40
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:42,020
♪I was raised♪

41
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:45,860
♪Amid cast-off bones and alleyways...♪

42
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:46,490
How annoying.

43
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,340
Why does it keep coming after me?

44
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,370
Maybe it likes your pretty face.

45
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,460
How annoying.

46
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:56,930
It has excellent taste.

47
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:03,340
♪I've turned to dust♪

48
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:08,380
♪And weathered every storm♪

49
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:14,180
♪Through another life, I look back once more♪

50
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:18,660
♪But who can I tell?♪

51
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,850
So it likes pretty things, huh?

52
00:05:21,940 --> 00:05:24,580
♪You're not like him, so don't choose to perish...♪

53
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,700
I'll trust you one more time.

54
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,260
You'd better catch it.

55
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,620
♪I'll overturn the way this world works♪

56
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:35,220
♪I'm not like him, so don't be deceived♪

57
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:37,860
♪Let half a crimson sun light my broken form♪

58
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,860
♪All that burns♪

59
00:05:39,860 --> 00:05:48,020
♪Is a lone flame beneath the brooding clouds♪

60
00:06:03,070 --> 00:06:03,610
Not bad.

61
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,810
Your skills are passable.

62
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,140
Open your hand.

63
00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:14,610
Why did it vanish?

64
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,100
Master Zhang,

65
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:27,460
I have to say,

66
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,730
couldn't you have been gentler?

67
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,220
We finally caught one alive,

68
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,460
and you made it vanish with one grab.

69
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,660
What exactly was that thing?

70
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:38,900
Probably one of the three imps in the mural.

71
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:45,370
Next time, you try, Fifth Master.

72
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:46,170
Show me how it's done.

73
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,020
I...

74
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,850
I only gave you the chance

75
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,170
because you love showing off.

76
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,170
Then thank you for the opportunity.

77
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:03,340
You're welcome.

78
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,460
Don't overthink it, Laogou.

79
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,930
If you're sure, do it.

80
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,460
Women in this world

81
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,730
have it far harder than men.

82
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,220
They're often forced to do

83
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:08,020
the most menial, degrading work.

84
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:10,340
You see the people's suffering

85
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:11,660
very clearly, Laogou.

86
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:16,700
I've simply seen too much.

87
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,050
Once we get out of here,

88
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,410
I'll see that you're duly rewarded.

89
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:23,930
Duly rewarded?

90
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:30,220
The position of Changsha Defense Commander.

91
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,300
You take Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays.

92
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,610
I'll take Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays.

93
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:35,730
How about that?

94
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:38,700
Agreed.

95
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:12,980
The son ends up a beggar

96
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,370
and works Madam Wang to death.

97
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:20,300
What nonsense, "Madam Wang's Lecture."

98
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:22,850
The son should decide his own fate.

99
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:24,700
Why should Madam Wang bear the burden?

100
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,530
What kind of world is this?

101
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:30,490
We may not be able to change the world,

102
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,180
but I hope that one day,

103
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,010
we'll all be masters of our own fate.

104
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,610
I hope so.

105
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:49,180
You're playing the bait next.

106
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:12,420
Careful. There may be a new punishment.

107
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,340
Come on,

108
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,490
you little imps.

109
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,100
Come and get me!

110
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:13,940
Good.

111
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,610
The imps are gone,

112
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:18,370
and the mechanism is disabled.

113
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,370
Let's take a break.

114
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,100
You rest. I'll keep looking.

115
00:12:02,210 --> 00:12:02,680
Whoa.

116
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,460
It vanished into thin air.

117
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:07,700
And it was a new one.

118
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,530
And it was skinny.

119
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,580
It was this thin.

120
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,370
Was it rolled out

121
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,370
like a noodle in its last life?

122
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:23,490
Where did this one come from?

123
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:25,580
Probably another one from the mural.

124
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,010
This thing

125
00:12:32,550 --> 00:12:33,700
can crawl into people.

126
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:38,420
Did you see where it went?

127
00:12:38,910 --> 00:12:39,490
No.

128
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:42,580
Let's check one by one.

129
00:12:53,030 --> 00:12:53,850
You scared me.

130
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:55,730
We don't know what we're dealing with.

131
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:57,580
We shouldn't split up.

132
00:12:58,270 --> 00:12:58,940
Stay close.

133
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:20,340
Are you hungry?

134
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,730
That smells delicious.

135
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:50,940
Laogou.

136
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,580
Did you find the skinny imp?

137
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:02,180
No.

138
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,300
Then why call my name?

139
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,610
Keep looking.

140
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,700
Something's wrong with you.

141
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,340
Just keep looking.

142
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,460
I'm perfectly fine.

143
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:21,370
Laogou!

144
00:14:34,510 --> 00:14:35,100
Zhang Qishan,

145
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:37,730
I think...

146
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,060
I think...

147
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:48,530
I'm all right.

148
00:14:48,870 --> 00:14:49,370
Zhang Qishan...

149
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:49,980
Don't move!

150
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:56,980
It's...

151
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,730
I'm starving.

152
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:02,610
Thank goodness.

153
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:03,890
Better Zhang Qishan than me.

154
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:11,940
I see.

155
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,490
This thing

156
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:16,010
can only possess one person at a time.

157
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,100
I'm starving.

158
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,770
Is this a hungry imp?

159
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,130
When will it be your turn?

160
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:34,700
I don't know.

161
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,220
I can't eat any more.

162
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,300
I can't eat any more.

163
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:52,940
Hungry imp, switch hosts!

164
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,460
Switch hosts!

165
00:15:55,750 --> 00:15:56,650
Switch hosts!

166
00:15:58,550 --> 00:16:00,470
Switch hosts!

167
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:13,650
This is infuriating!

168
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:20,460
Miss Huo, you call the shots.

169
00:16:21,030 --> 00:16:22,220
We'll do whatever you say.

170
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:33,940
I don't know,

171
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:37,300
but no one could be inside that hole.

172
00:16:38,670 --> 00:16:39,820
The gap inside is tiny.

173
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,490
No person could possibly fit.

174
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,980
Even if someone got in,

175
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:45,890
they would've been crushed beyond recognition.

176
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,340
They couldn't possibly be alive.

177
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:50,250
Miss Huo is on their side.

178
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:51,890
Bring out all the explosives.

179
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,100
We'll blast open the ceiling.

180
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:53,730
- Yes. - Stop.

181
00:16:54,870 --> 00:16:55,940
Didn't you say you'd listen to me?

182
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,250
If the ceiling collapses,

183
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:59,180
we'll all be buried in here.

184
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:02,460
Juanlian.

185
00:17:02,630 --> 00:17:03,100
Juanlian.

186
00:17:07,790 --> 00:17:09,220
Are you trying to get Fifth Master killed?

187
00:17:09,790 --> 00:17:10,530
Give me the explosives.

188
00:17:11,590 --> 00:17:11,980
Tiezui.

189
00:17:14,110 --> 00:17:14,980
Take everyone

190
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,700
somewhere safe and find cover.

191
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,140
I'll handle the blast. It's safer.

192
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,980
Wait, Xiangu, you... I...

193
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,810
Fine.

194
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:17,330
Master!

195
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,220
Master!

196
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:20,140
Master!

197
00:18:22,070 --> 00:18:23,770
Juanlian, it's a dead end.

198
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,250
Did the blast send Master flying?

199
00:18:25,550 --> 00:18:26,860
Why didn't you say so earlier?

200
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,290
I thought once he heard us preparing the blast,

201
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,330
he'd get out of the way.

202
00:18:29,550 --> 00:18:30,460
It's sealed off above.

203
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,330
But when you lit the fuses earlier, the smoke moved.

204
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,330
There must be a mechanism up there.

205
00:18:35,510 --> 00:18:37,900
A narrow gap traps heat.

206
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:39,660
The temperatures inside and outside differed,

207
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,090
so the smoke naturally drifted toward it.

208
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,980
Are you happy now?

209
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,420
But we all saw that hand.

210
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:50,660
Even if it wasn't Fifth Master's,

211
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,050
there must be some explanation.

212
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,810
Could there really be a ghost?

213
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,770
Enough. Stop making wild guesses.

214
00:19:00,590 --> 00:19:01,770
This tower must have lured us here

215
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:03,420
for some other purpose.

216
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,810
What do you suggest we do, Eighth Master?

217
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:08,620
Three words.

218
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,490
Stick together.

219
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:11,090
Isn't that two words?

220
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,900
Master Zhang and Fifth Master aren't here,

221
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,660
so we have to hold the line for them.

222
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,380
We can't let this tower have its way.

223
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,490
Zhang Qishan,

224
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,220
I kept something from you.

225
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:28,330
There were two characters on that red ball.

226
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,310
I may not be able to read,

227
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:32,050
but I recognized the shape.

228
00:19:32,550 --> 00:19:33,780
It should be "Peng Ju."

229
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,390
Have you heard of the Three Worms?

230
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:39,670
A folk healer

231
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:42,400
once told me

232
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:46,810
that everyone is born with three parasites inside.

233
00:19:48,190 --> 00:19:49,700
To live a long life,

234
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:52,850
you have to kill all three.

235
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,500
The Three Worms are

236
00:19:54,910 --> 00:19:55,740
Peng Ju,

237
00:19:56,190 --> 00:19:56,980
Peng Zhi,

238
00:19:57,670 --> 00:19:58,500
and Peng Qiao.

239
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,570
Peng Ju is drawn to beauty

240
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:02,690
and lavish finery.

241
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:04,370
It dwells in the head.

242
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:05,780
Peng Zhi

243
00:20:06,190 --> 00:20:07,090
craves delicacies

244
00:20:07,590 --> 00:20:08,570
and dwells in the belly.

245
00:20:09,150 --> 00:20:09,890
Peng Qiao

246
00:20:11,590 --> 00:20:12,700
dwells in the dantian

247
00:20:13,910 --> 00:20:15,170
and stirs up the heart-fire.

248
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:23,780
The three imps in the mural

249
00:20:24,170 --> 00:20:25,940
are the Three Worms within the great ghost.

250
00:20:26,830 --> 00:20:28,890
That red ball was Peng Ju.

251
00:20:29,630 --> 00:20:32,650
The hungry imp haunting us now

252
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:34,500
is Peng Zhi.

253
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,940
If Peng Ju can be killed,

254
00:20:37,430 --> 00:20:38,740
then Peng Zhi can be killed too.

255
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:46,260
Zhang Qishan,

256
00:20:47,650 --> 00:20:49,650
hurry up and find a way to kill it,

257
00:20:50,910 --> 00:20:52,810
or I might really eat you.

258
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,220
Where are you going?

259
00:20:58,070 --> 00:20:58,810
I'm fishing it out.

260
00:20:59,310 --> 00:21:01,860
I'll lure Peng Zhi out of your belly.

261
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,330
Could you hurry?

262
00:21:10,110 --> 00:21:10,900
Zhang Qishan,

263
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,330
do you have anything else to eat?

264
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:16,730
Yes.

265
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:25,860
What are you doing?

266
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,050
Desperate times.

267
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,570
You'll have to make do.

268
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:45,490
Come on.

269
00:21:54,510 --> 00:21:55,090
Wait!

270
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:02,460
This is revolting.

271
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,330
Master Zhang,

272
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:12,900
it's finally your turn.

273
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:30,620
Zhang Qishan,

274
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,530
tell me,

275
00:22:33,790 --> 00:22:35,490
if I stab it now,

276
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,380
will you die too?

277
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,290
I don't know about it,

278
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,570
but I certainly will.

279
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,490
Then make do with this.

280
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,180
You'd really eat that?

281
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:07,860
Stop playing around,

282
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,940
or I'll eat you too.

283
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:14,380
Fine.

284
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,490
You said it yourself.

285
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:19,420
I'll lure it out for you.

286
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:21,620
Brace yourself.

287
00:23:48,830 --> 00:23:49,570
This thing

288
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:52,180
can jump between us in an instant.

289
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:56,660
I think...

290
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:01,220
Better Zhang Qishan than me.

291
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:04,810
Wait!

292
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,180
It's the eyes.

293
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:11,330
It moves back and forth through eye contact.

294
00:24:13,310 --> 00:24:14,700
So even if we lure it out,

295
00:24:15,590 --> 00:24:16,940
it'll just possess one of us again.

296
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,290
Then wasn't that whole plan useless?

297
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:20,330
What do we do?

298
00:24:26,510 --> 00:24:28,330
Since it came from the mechanism,

299
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:30,420
we'll disable the mechanism.

300
00:24:31,920 --> 00:24:32,810
What if the imp

301
00:24:33,310 --> 00:24:34,980
still won't leave after we disable it?

302
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:37,530
Then we'll find a way to kill it.

303
00:24:38,830 --> 00:24:39,420
Wait.

304
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:41,530
What if we disable it

305
00:24:42,110 --> 00:24:43,810
and another imp appears?

306
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:45,810
Then you can eat it.

307
00:24:46,790 --> 00:24:47,730
But the next imp

308
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,240
is Peng Qiao.

309
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:53,860
It stirs up the heart-fire.

310
00:24:59,070 --> 00:25:01,230
Zhang Qishan, you'd better hurry.

311
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:02,980
I'm starving to death!

312
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:12,180
A play often moves people

313
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:14,330
in a single moment.

314
00:25:15,830 --> 00:25:16,700
The same goes for mechanisms.

315
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:19,180
They may look complicated,

316
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:22,290
but it's all misdirection.

317
00:25:23,590 --> 00:25:25,140
We need to simplify it.

318
00:25:45,750 --> 00:25:46,660
Bravo!

319
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:53,620
I know how to solve it.

320
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:43,330
Still hungry?

321
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:57,180
Did you disable the mechanism?

322
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:58,770
Yes.

323
00:27:12,750 --> 00:27:14,050
That wretched Peng Zhi.

324
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:15,770
If I ever see you again,

325
00:27:16,310 --> 00:27:17,570
I'll starve you

326
00:27:18,160 --> 00:27:19,140
into a chopstick imp!

327
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:23,530
Didn't you say you weren't hungry?

328
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,180
What?

329
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,290
After all we've been through,

330
00:27:30,070 --> 00:27:31,010
aren't you hungry too?

331
00:27:34,550 --> 00:27:35,570
Untie me!

332
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:55,490
The son becomes the top scholar,

333
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:58,380
and Madam Wang can finally live in comfort.

334
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:03,330
Surely we got it right this time, right?

335
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:20,010
Of the creatures on that relief,

336
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:21,620
we've encountered

337
00:28:22,550 --> 00:28:24,050
the giant serpent, Peng Ju, and Peng Zhi.

338
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:27,420
So beyond this passage lies

339
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,290
the great ghost.

340
00:28:59,270 --> 00:28:59,860
Xiangu,

341
00:29:00,830 --> 00:29:02,610
I know you're worried about Laogou.

342
00:29:03,510 --> 00:29:04,160
With him gone,

343
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,730
you must feel unsettled.

344
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:10,500
You can't hide it from me.

345
00:29:11,590 --> 00:29:14,420
I once read a book called "Strange Tales of Penglai".

346
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,110
It said

347
00:29:19,750 --> 00:29:22,290
that feelings like yours and Laogou's...

348
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:25,140
At a time like this,

349
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,900
instead of worrying about everyone's safety,

350
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,180
you're talking about that?

351
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,380
I'm the Eighth Master.

352
00:29:33,070 --> 00:29:34,180
I keep all eight sides covered

353
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:35,810
and concern myself with everything.

354
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,350
What did the book say?

355
00:29:40,750 --> 00:29:43,940
"A lone goose flies east, with a corner to the west.

356
00:29:44,550 --> 00:29:46,250
Eastward, it may arrive.

357
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:49,330
A lone goose flies west, with a corner to the west.

358
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,420
Westward, it cannot arrive."

359
00:29:52,110 --> 00:29:52,810
What does that mean?

360
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,880
The book has been lost.

361
00:29:55,030 --> 00:29:56,700
I was only teasing you.

362
00:29:56,750 --> 00:29:59,900
That line can't be deciphered.

363
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:08,780
That's Tu.

364
00:30:09,310 --> 00:30:10,860
Juanlian, that's Tu!

365
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:27,290
Madam Huo, Eighth Master, a picture from Fifth Master!

366
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:31,860
Fifth Master says

367
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,250
the place they've reached looks like the Underworld.

368
00:30:35,750 --> 00:30:37,250
If his picture reaches us,

369
00:30:37,570 --> 00:30:38,490
the two places

370
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,620
must be linked by a mechanism.

371
00:30:40,310 --> 00:30:40,810
Keep looking.

372
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:41,770
If we can't find a way,

373
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,180
Eighth Master can perform another ritual

374
00:30:43,510 --> 00:30:44,250
and send us all over there.

375
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:44,980
Eighth Master,

376
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:47,330
please begin at once.

377
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:51,530
This place doesn't look

378
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,600
like the great ghost is here.

379
00:32:58,110 --> 00:32:59,660
What could be inside these vats?

380
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:02,510
Don't touch them.

381
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:06,120
The lids

382
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,290
bear Daoist symbols.

383
00:33:09,090 --> 00:33:10,900
They seem to be suppressing something.

384
00:33:13,830 --> 00:33:14,730
Zhang Qishan,

385
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:17,060
don't tell me you're afraid.

386
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:20,250
Then open one.

387
00:33:21,750 --> 00:33:22,900
I should be able to protect you.

388
00:33:24,830 --> 00:33:25,770
I think

389
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,460
we should understand the situation

390
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,330
before deciding what to do.

391
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:56,980
What's written there?

392
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,140
They seem to be notes

393
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:08,260
on herbs and alchemy.

394
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,900
They may have been studying magic.

395
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:14,340
Magic?

396
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,860
Why would that require so many vats?

397
00:34:25,030 --> 00:34:26,820
Could they all be filled with magic pills?

398
00:34:29,550 --> 00:34:30,280
But there isn't

399
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:32,020
a single alchemy furnace in this room.

400
00:34:32,760 --> 00:34:34,390
They could be the alchemists' test subjects.

401
00:34:42,510 --> 00:34:44,380
Looks like another dead end.

402
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:58,690
Why is there hair on this mural?

403
00:35:23,510 --> 00:35:24,980
All this hair has rotted away.

404
00:35:44,510 --> 00:35:45,010
Laogou!

405
00:35:52,800 --> 00:35:53,340
In this place,

406
00:35:54,230 --> 00:35:56,380
alchemists experimented on people and animals.

407
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,820
The vats contain people and animals of all kinds.

408
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:08,420
So that's what happened.

409
00:36:10,480 --> 00:36:11,690
The alchemists fed their pills

410
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:13,260
to people and animals,

411
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:15,570
causing them to mutate.

412
00:36:15,590 --> 00:36:16,740
This place is a prison.

413
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,820
They locked all their mutated creations

414
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:22,940
inside these vats.

415
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:25,610
Were all these monsters

416
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:27,340
created by the Otherworld Patriarch?

417
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:28,690
If he was so powerful,

418
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:30,010
why did he need to be a fraud?

419
00:36:31,590 --> 00:36:32,050
No.

420
00:36:32,710 --> 00:36:33,530
The things here

421
00:36:34,230 --> 00:36:35,130
are clearly much older.

422
00:36:36,550 --> 00:36:37,090
I understand now.

423
00:36:39,360 --> 00:36:40,780
When the Otherworld Patriarch built the tower,

424
00:36:40,790 --> 00:36:41,560
he uncovered this place

425
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:45,490
and linked it to the tower through mechanisms.

426
00:36:47,230 --> 00:36:48,840
He also wanted to use these monsters

427
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:51,760
to make his followers believe he had magic powers.

428
00:36:52,110 --> 00:36:54,850
But his plan failed, and the monsters escaped.

429
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,990
So he had to abandon the Otherworld Tower.

430
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:58,820
Now we have to deal with what he unleashed.

431
00:37:00,190 --> 00:37:01,340
Can we even handle them?

432
00:37:02,230 --> 00:37:03,980
That shadow alone had us running in circles.

433
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:05,980
Even the darkest evil

434
00:37:06,310 --> 00:37:07,290
follows a pattern.

435
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,460
Once we see the pattern,

436
00:37:09,790 --> 00:37:10,770
it won't be hard to handle.

437
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:13,730
We've come all this way

438
00:37:14,040 --> 00:37:15,060
without finding a single clue.

439
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:16,570
But perhaps

440
00:37:16,590 --> 00:37:18,020
the key clue already appeared,

441
00:37:18,750 --> 00:37:19,900
and we simply overlooked it.

442
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:38,170
Zhang Qishan, come with me.

443
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:46,770
Look at this.

444
00:37:47,150 --> 00:37:48,060
Could this be what we missed?

445
00:37:59,790 --> 00:38:00,290
Zhang Qishan,

446
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,500
what do you think it means that a man

447
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,170
was hidden beneath this hair?

448
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:05,340
I don't know.

449
00:38:06,040 --> 00:38:08,090
But he outranks even the great Underworld King.

450
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:11,130
Is this mural identical

451
00:38:11,750 --> 00:38:12,900
to the relief outside?

452
00:38:16,840 --> 00:38:17,380
No.

453
00:38:18,840 --> 00:38:20,290
This man isn't on the relief.

454
00:38:21,040 --> 00:38:22,340
There, the great ghost rides the serpent.

455
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:23,540
But in this mural,

456
00:38:24,110 --> 00:38:25,500
it has swallowed the serpent into its body.

457
00:38:26,190 --> 00:38:26,900
What does that mean?

458
00:38:29,080 --> 00:38:29,500
Look.

459
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,130
The man above

460
00:38:31,310 --> 00:38:32,250
is the true master of this place.

461
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,650
Don't think of the great ghost as a ghost.

462
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,900
Think of it as a map.

463
00:38:38,110 --> 00:38:39,770
The ghost's head beneath its master is one room.

464
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:42,340
The serpent in its belly is another.

465
00:38:43,630 --> 00:38:45,130
What place does the map formed by this great ghost

466
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:47,020
represent?

467
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,900
The Otherworld Tower itself.

468
00:39:09,060 --> 00:39:09,930
In the zaju version of "Journey to the West,"

469
00:39:09,930 --> 00:39:10,780
there's a scene

470
00:39:11,190 --> 00:39:12,530
where Sun Wukong alters the Book of Life and Death.

471
00:39:13,190 --> 00:39:13,940
He passes Pingdu Mountain

472
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:14,940
in the Underworld

473
00:39:15,510 --> 00:39:16,380
and meets an immortal

474
00:39:17,150 --> 00:39:18,530
wearing an exceptionally tall hat.

475
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:21,820
The immortal's abode is built upon a great ghost.

476
00:39:23,110 --> 00:39:23,900
His name is...

477
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,090
Yin Changsheng.

478
00:39:29,320 --> 00:39:29,780
Look.

479
00:39:31,630 --> 00:39:32,690
That's Yin Changsheng.

480
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:41,690
I understand now.

481
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,370
The master of this place

482
00:39:44,480 --> 00:39:45,460
is Yin Changsheng.

483
00:39:46,590 --> 00:39:47,980
He practiced alchemy and mystic arts here,

484
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:49,650
then imprisoned all the monsters

485
00:39:50,110 --> 00:39:51,170
he created through his arts.

486
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:52,820
Yes.

487
00:39:53,230 --> 00:39:53,860
That's it.

488
00:39:54,550 --> 00:39:55,210
Yin Changsheng

489
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:57,740
knows tricks that can manipulate

490
00:39:58,230 --> 00:39:59,260
and reverse time,

491
00:40:00,030 --> 00:40:01,490
and make the sun set in the east and rise in the west.

492
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:04,380
Every detail along our way makes sense now.

493
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,130
Tiezui once said

494
00:40:07,110 --> 00:40:08,340
these were the divine powers

495
00:40:08,670 --> 00:40:10,090
the Otherworld Patriarch claimed to possess.

496
00:40:11,030 --> 00:40:12,650
Now it seems

497
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:13,900
all his deceptions

498
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,340
began only after he

499
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:16,690
broke through into this place.

500
00:40:17,630 --> 00:40:19,050
This was where he found his inspiration.

501
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:20,400
Perhaps they weren't deceptions.

502
00:40:21,280 --> 00:40:21,980
The Otherworld Patriarch

503
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:23,430
may truly have believed

504
00:40:23,430 --> 00:40:24,340
these feats could be achieved.

505
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:26,460
So after he found this place,

506
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:28,490
he genuinely tried to learn them.

507
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:32,260
To learn Yin Changsheng's methods.

508
00:40:34,670 --> 00:40:35,210
Exactly.

509
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:40,420
He found a way into this place,

510
00:40:41,110 --> 00:40:42,170
but he never expected

511
00:40:43,030 --> 00:40:44,010
that once he entered,

512
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:45,090
he would find it

513
00:40:45,110 --> 00:40:46,440
filled with monsters created by Yin.

514
00:40:47,510 --> 00:40:48,420
He got the methods wrong,

515
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,980
and his followers paid the price.

516
00:40:51,550 --> 00:40:52,420
It ended in tragedy.

517
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:53,820
As for him,

518
00:40:54,630 --> 00:40:55,340
he could only flee.

519
00:40:56,510 --> 00:40:57,380
Once outside,

520
00:40:57,760 --> 00:40:58,650
he built high walls,

521
00:40:58,960 --> 00:40:59,860
hoping to keep every monster

522
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,460
trapped inside the Otherworld Tower.

523
00:41:01,670 --> 00:41:02,300
That's impossible.

524
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,920
It makes sense,

525
00:41:05,150 --> 00:41:07,210
but there must be more to it.

526
00:41:09,030 --> 00:41:09,690
What about the shadow?

527
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:11,570
How do you explain that?

528
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,530
If I were writing this play,

529
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,170
the shadow would be this man,

530
00:41:16,960 --> 00:41:17,860
Yin Changsheng himself.

531
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:22,340
He probably took one of his own pills

532
00:41:23,110 --> 00:41:24,650
and became neither human nor ghost.

533
00:41:29,000 --> 00:41:29,980
Quite a show

534
00:41:30,510 --> 00:41:31,610
has unfolded in this tower.

535
00:41:54,660 --> 00:41:57,260
[Yin Changsheng]

536
00:42:14,540 --> 00:42:18,700
♪The past fades like smoke♪

537
00:42:19,060 --> 00:42:21,780
♪A choice is made in silence♪

538
00:42:22,060 --> 00:42:24,860
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

539
00:42:25,260 --> 00:42:29,020
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

540
00:42:29,260 --> 00:42:32,700
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

541
00:42:32,980 --> 00:42:36,380
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

542
00:42:36,460 --> 00:42:43,740
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

543
00:42:44,180 --> 00:42:47,460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

544
00:42:47,740 --> 00:42:50,980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

545
00:42:51,140 --> 00:42:55,180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

546
00:42:55,380 --> 00:42:58,740
♪Who believes in fate?♪

547
00:42:58,980 --> 00:43:02,340
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

548
00:43:02,580 --> 00:43:05,860
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

549
00:43:06,180 --> 00:43:09,860
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

550
00:43:10,060 --> 00:43:13,300
♪Take care♪

551
00:43:13,300 --> 00:43:15,860
♪We once raced♪

552
00:43:15,940 --> 00:43:17,860
♪For the dawn♪

553
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:21,300
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

554
00:43:21,420 --> 00:43:24,700
♪In the web of fate♪

555
00:43:24,700 --> 00:43:27,900
♪No one can escape♪

556
00:43:28,900 --> 00:43:30,740
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

557
00:43:30,900 --> 00:43:32,460
♪We too were young once♪

558
00:43:32,540 --> 00:43:35,980
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

559
00:43:36,180 --> 00:43:38,500
♪Keep the ember lit♪

560
00:43:38,620 --> 00:43:43,140
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

561
00:43:43,260 --> 00:43:46,220
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

562
00:43:46,460 --> 00:43:49,980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

563
00:43:50,100 --> 00:43:53,860
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

564
00:43:54,180 --> 00:43:57,660
♪Who believes in fate?♪

565
00:43:57,820 --> 00:44:00,820
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

566
00:44:01,060 --> 00:44:04,820
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

567
00:44:04,980 --> 00:44:08,700
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

568
00:44:08,820 --> 00:44:20,260
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
